"Habitus @ City of Elmina, Denai Alam | New Serviced Apartment/SOVO for sale | NuProp (https://nuprop.my/selangor/shah-alam/habitus-city-of-elmina?lang=en)\nciteturn239search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 1.3 years ago; # Habitus @ City of Elmina, Denai Alam ... Studio Unit(451 sq.ft) - 3 Bedrooms(998 sq.ft) ... HABITUS is a mixed development project which consists of Serviced Apartment units and Small Office Virtual Office (SOVO) that offer diverse practical features for different lifestyles.\n  1.   2.   3.   4.   5.   6. Previous Next\n\n# Habitus @ City of Elmina, Denai Alam\n\n### From RM289,000\n\nDenai Alam, 40170 Shah Alam, Selangor\n\nServiced Apartment/SOVO\n\nStudio Unit(451 sq.ft) - 3 Bedrooms(998 sq.ft)\n\nMove-in Ready\n\nNewfields Group\n\nFor Own Stay\n\nPoint\n\n\n## Project Details\n\n## A Freehold Development in Denai Alam Within The Prestigious City of Elmina\n\nIntroducing HABITUS, the first freehold high-rise development of its kind in the heart of City of Elmina, Shah Alam. Developed by Denai 23 Sdn Bhd (a subsidiary of Newfields Group), HABITUS embodies its concept “Modern Heritage Living”, which represents the unification of modern and traditional influences from the diverse Malay, Chinese and Indian cultures. \n\nIts location in the City of Elmina makes living easy and convenient. Recognized as a vibrant and thriving township, the City of Elmina offers plenty of amenities and features that satisfy its residents’ living styles.  With bountiful of lush green open spaces scattered around the township, HABITUS residents can experience tranquillity and peace, even more so with balconies provided for most units that allow a stunning panoramic view of the City of Elmina. \n\nHABITUS is a mixed development project which consists of Serviced Apartment units and Small Office Virtual Office (SOVO) that offer diverse practical features for different lifestyles. Built to provide efficient co-living and co-working spaces, this development offers functional working spaces in its SOVO units, as well as private and comfortable living in its residential rooms. Business and relaxation all under one roof, only in HABITUS.\n\n## Modern and Convenient Living for Families and Young Professionals\n\nHABITUS isn't just a freehold high-rise, it offers a space for you to own and for your community to grow. For young entrepreneurs seeking a modern flexible office, HABITUS SOVO presents an ideal workspace with practical facilities such as an office, pantry, 2 workstation areas, and a space for discussions or meetings. In contrast, the residential units (Type A, B, C, and D) offers living spaces from 565 sq. ft. to 998 sq. ft., with 1 until 3 bedrooms. Each unit is designed with an open layout to give a feeling of airy spaciousness, while also allowing natural lighting and ventilation circulating throughout the house. \nCommercial Centers\n\n  * E-Boulevard Denai Alam (800 m)\n  * D’Pangkin Commercial Center (7.2 km)\n  * Dana 1 Commercial Center – Ara Damansara (13.8 km)\n\nRecreational Centers/Parks\n\n  * Motocross Track Bukit Subang (1.8 km)\n  * Denai Alam Recreational and Riding Club (1.9 km)\n  * Elmina Central Park (3.8 km)\n  * Monterez Golf & Country Club (4.4 km)\n  * Denai Larian Bukit Jelutong (6.8 km)\n  * Mudtrekker Paintball Park (7 km)\n\nAlthough situated away from the city, HABITUS has high connectivity to other cities via multiple major highways. For example, the Damansara-Shah Alam Highway (DASH) or the Guthrie Corridor Expressway (GCE) allows easy travel to KL City Centre. Furthermore, HABITUS is conveniently accessible to mature townships such as Shah Alam, Damansara, Sungai Buloh, and Mont Kiara via the Penchala Link and Damansara-Puchong Expressway (LDP).\n\n## Features\n\nLand title: Mixed development \n\nTenure: Freehold \n\nBuilt-up size: 451 – 998 sq. ft. \n\nNo. of units: 305\n\n## Floor Plan\n\nType SOVO\n\nFrom RM289K\n\n451 sq.ft\n\nStudio Unit\n\n1 Bathroom\n\n* * *\n\nType A\n\nFrom RM369K\n\n565 sq.ft\n\nStudio Unit\n\n1 Bathroom\n\n* * *\n\nType B\n\nFrom RM450K\n\n685 sq.ft\n\n1 + 1 Bedrooms\n\n1 Bathroom\n\n* * *\n\nType C\n\nFrom RM555K\n\n844 sq.ft\n\n2 + 1 Bedrooms\n\n2 Bathrooms\n\n* * *\n\nType D\n\nFrom RM641K\n\n998 sq.ft\n\n3 Bedrooms\n\n2 Bathrooms\n\n## Location Map\n\n## Company Information\n\nNewfields Group\n\nUnit 10-1 (Ground Floor), Jalan Elektron G U/16 G, Denai Alam, 40160 Shah Alam, Selangor\n\n[Input] Read More\n\nNewfields land was founded in 2004 and property development is one of its core pillars. Newfields Land b elieved that with the same allegiance to detail and conception, Newfields Land was capable to build a presence in the property market in Malaysia. W ith the project DNA of each project, it can grow into its own sustainable community alongside an aggressive land acquisition program recently put into place. Newfields Land has always brings professional expertise to devise high quality residential and commercial properties.\n\nHabitus, for Sale developed by Newfields Group. Habitus, From RM 289K. You can check out the project details of Habitus with photos, price, floor plans, facilities, and more. NuProp helps new home buyers & investors to find new properties in Malaysia.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nFacilities – Habitus (https://www.habitus.com.my/facilities/)\nciteturn239search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; G-R-05, Habitus (Denai 128) ... 17, Persiaran Metafasa, Denai Alam\n\n# A Sanctuary For The Senses\n\nHabitus brings together a whole new way of urban living with a sense of style and comfort. Imagine soaking in this picturesque setting, a remarkable haven for the senses.\n\nImage: Swimming Pool\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nImage: Playground\n\nPlayground\n\nImage: Pool Deck\n\nPool Deck\n\nImage: Gym\n\nGym\n\nImage: Co-Living Lounge\n\nCo-Living Lounge\n\nImage: Entertainment & BBQ Deck\n\nEntertainment & BBQ Deck\n\nHabitus Sales Gallery\nG-R-05, Habitus (Denai 128